{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"孔子·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"confucius","categoryLabel":"孔子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/01_confucius/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"孔子-影响与遗产\">孔子·影响与遗产</h1><p>孔子（公元前551年—公元前479年）生前是一位在政治上不得志的鲁国士人，周游列国十四年终不见用。然而在他身后的两千五百余年里，这位自嘲&quot;丧家之狗&quot;的失意者被一步步抬升为&quot;至圣先师&quot;&quot;万世师表&quot;，成为东亚文明共同的精神坐标。本 hub 聚焦这段&quot;身后之事&quot;：一个人的思想如何被反复重塑、制度化、神圣化，又如何在不同时代被推崇、被利用、被批判、被重新发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>孔子主题共六个 hub，各有明确边界。本 hub 回答的问题是：<strong>孔子身后发生了什么</strong>——他的形象如何被建构，思想如何被制度化并向外扩散，遗产在近现代与当代经历了怎样的起落。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>讲什么</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>出身、从政、周游列国、晚年与去世</td>\n<td>生平叙事止于公元前479年；本 hub 从去世后的官方追念讲起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>有教无类、仁礼之学、君子理想等贡献本身</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲这些贡献身后如何被放大与制度化，不重复论证其内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>仁、礼、天命、正名等概念的义理细节</td>\n<td>本 hub 引用这些概念但不展开哲学分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a></td>\n<td>《论语》的成书与六经的整理</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲经典的&quot;接受史&quot;（谁把它定为考纲），而非文本本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>历代毁誉的分歧细节与近现代批判的学理</td>\n<td>本 hub 按影响线索叙述命运起伏；对孔子的是非评判归该 hub</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断内容归属的简明法则：孔子<strong>生前</strong>的事归生平与思想类 hub；孔子<strong>死后</strong>被如何对待归本 hub；对这种对待本身的<strong>评判</strong>归争议与评价 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-内部结构\">本 hub 内部结构</h2><p>三章八篇，沿时间与空间两条线索推进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"canonization-and-state-cult/\">神圣化与国家崇拜</a></strong>——制度线：封号与孔庙（崇拜的空间化）、科举与正统（思想的制度化）、衍圣公世家（神圣化的血脉化）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"transmission-and-east-asian-spread/\">传播与东亚扩散</a></strong>——空间线：理学对经典体系的重构、儒教圈在朝鲜、日本、越南的本土化，收束于近现代的批判与重估。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"global-legacy-today/\">全球遗产与当下</a></strong>——当下线：孔子学院的软实力兴衰，以及儒家与民主、性别、人工智能关系的最新争论。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>零基础读者</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 建立人物轮廓，再按 1→2→3 章顺序通读本 hub。全程无需专业背景，体量约相当于一部短篇思想史。</li>\n<li><strong>已有中国史基础的读者</strong>：可直接从第一章读起（制度史线索最密集），再跳读第三章；若已熟悉宋明理学，第二章可只读 <a href=\"transmission-and-east-asian-spread/spread-to-east-asia\">东亚儒教圈</a> 一篇补足比较视野。</li>\n<li><strong>关注当代政治与国际关系的读者</strong>：先读 <a href=\"transmission-and-east-asian-spread/critique-and-modern-reassessment\">批判与重估</a> 理解官方态度逆转的来龙去脉，再进入第三章两篇——孔子学院与当代争论皆以此为前提。</li>\n<li><strong>教学或研究者</strong>：建议配合 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 对照阅读：本 hub 提供影响的&quot;事实链&quot;，该 hub 提供评价的&quot;分歧图&quot;，二者拼合才是完整图景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《论语》的基本面貌</strong>：知道它是由弟子辑录的言行录即可进入本 hub；版本与成书问题见 <a href=\"../major-works/the-analects/compilation-and-versions\">《论语》的成书与版本</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>仁与礼的含义</strong>：本 hub 多处涉及&quot;仁礼&quot;被后世重新诠释，概念本义见 <a href=\"../core-contributions/ethical-political-thought/ren-and-li\">仁与礼</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>朝代脉络</strong>：汉→唐→宋→元→明→清的大致先后，以及&quot;帝制官僚体系&quot;的基本常识——本 hub 的封号、科举、庙制均嵌在这条时间线上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下入口属于兄弟 hub，供读完本 hub 后继续探索：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/from-sage-to-deity\">从圣人到神明</a>：与本 hub 第一章同一神圣化过程的另一种评价视角。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/global-and-contemporary/contemporary-revival-and-reassessment\">当代复兴与重估</a>：与本 hub 第三章同一当代场域中的评价之争细节。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"canonization-and-state-cult","title":"封圣与国家祭祀","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/canonization-and-state-cult","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"posthumous-titles-and-temples","title":"谥号累加与孔庙体系：一位思想家如何被册封为\"王\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/canonization-and-state-cult/posthumous-titles-and-temples"},{"seq":2,"slug":"imperial-examination-and-orthodoxy","title":"科举与官方正统：儒家经典如何成为帝国的\"操作系统\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/canonization-and-state-cult/imperial-examination-and-orthodoxy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kong-family-and-descendants","title":"衍圣公与曲阜孔氏：中国延续最久的世家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/canonization-and-state-cult/kong-family-and-descendants"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"transmission-and-east-asian-spread","title":"经典传承与东亚传播","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/transmission-and-east-asian-spread","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classics-and-neo-confucianism","title":"经典与理学：从《论语》到朱熹、王阳明的思想重构","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/transmission-and-east-asian-spread/classics-and-neo-confucianism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spread-to-east-asia","title":"东亚儒教圈：朝鲜、日本、越南的本土化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/transmission-and-east-asian-spread/spread-to-east-asia"},{"seq":3,"slug":"critique-and-modern-reassessment","title":"批判与重估：从\"打倒孔家店\"到新儒家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/transmission-and-east-asian-spread/critique-and-modern-reassessment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-legacy-today","title":"当代世界的孔子遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/global-legacy-today","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"confucius-institutes-and-soft-power","title":"孔子学院与软实力：一个古代圣人的当代政治化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/global-legacy-today/confucius-institutes-and-soft-power"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contemporary-relevance-and-debates","title":"当代相关性与争论：儒家在民主、性别与AI时代","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/confucius/influence-and-legacy/global-legacy-today/contemporary-relevance-and-debates"}]}]}